### UStudent API - Course Management Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Get All Courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### Get Available Courses for Student 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses?studentId=1

### Get Available Courses for Student 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses?studentId=2

### Check Course Schedules (Debug)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules

### Check CS101 Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/1

### Check CS201 Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/2

### Check MATH101 Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/3